# Keep research/papers, research/figures, research/sources, docs (including
# historical evidence and archives), datasets manifests, tests, source code,
# dependency lock files visible. Local reports/ are excluded above; publish
# selected verification summaries under docs/ when needed.
# Do not blanket-ignore *.json, *.csv, *.png, *.svg, *.ipynb or docs/archive/.
